'''The Wild Dance (Deadly)''' is the first stage of [[Clan of the Maniacs]]. It features every [[:Category:Crazed Cats|Crazed Cat]] enemy variant. It is a [[No Continues]] stage. Unlike [[Insane Rhythms (Merciless)|Insane Rhythms]], each Crazed Cat spawns at different rates, rather than all at once. Beating this stage for the first time will drop a [[Cat Capsule|Rare Ticket]].

